{"4579060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brimvahl Crown", "steam_appid": 4579060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Frozen Wonderland Full of Stories and Mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eldynia is a place of complicated history. They may be the nation of seraphs, but due to their frozen climate, they resort to invading and pillaging neighboring nations, robbing them of their supplies and even families. This resulted in them having rich resources and diverse inhabitants, however, they all live in hatred towards the Eldynians. Explore more about this land and its stories as knowledge of its secrets can help you overcome the formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/938bd30441ae808b3cdfa1747bcebe3a.poster.avif?t=1775537362\" width=698 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/938bd30441ae808b3cdfa1747bcebe3a.webm?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/938bd30441ae808b3cdfa1747bcebe3a.mp4?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Intense Bosses in Challenging Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Brimvahl Crown is easy to learn yet hard to master. as you guide Kazmiel to become the Pantocrator once again and save the world from the Deathless King, you'll need to explore the balance between attacking and avoiding damage, doing parries, and use a variety of skills, spells, and combos, and perfect your timing to take advantage of the opponent's weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/5cefbee31b591e48bd2ddf3817546c3e.poster.avif?t=1775537362\" width=698 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/5cefbee31b591e48bd2ddf3817546c3e.webm?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/5cefbee31b591e48bd2ddf3817546c3e.mp4?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Build Kazmiel as Your Own Seraph</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Kazmiel your own legend. There are many ways to combine her armor, skills, and ultimate. You can develop Kazmiel according to your play style. No matter if you prefer aggressive close ranged confrontation, tactical ranged attacks, or a mix of both, you'll be able to find a build that supports your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/942e388b7e7dfddac66b56ffbc878e32.poster.avif?t=1775537362\" width=698 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/942e388b7e7dfddac66b56ffbc878e32.webm?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/942e388b7e7dfddac66b56ffbc878e32.mp4?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Epic Narrative of a Legendary Seraph</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mythology of Brimvahl Crown has intense narratives that depending on what Kazmiel chooses, could unravel very differently. Kazmiel is a legend, but nobody ever says she was always a hero in every route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Frozen Wonderland Full of Stories and Mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eldynia is a place of complicated history. They may be the nation of seraphs, but due to their frozen climate, they resort to invading and pillaging neighboring nations, robbing them of their supplies and even families. This resulted in them having rich resources and diverse inhabitants, however, they all live in hatred towards the Eldynians. Explore more about this land and its stories as knowledge of its secrets can help you overcome the formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/938bd30441ae808b3cdfa1747bcebe3a.poster.avif?t=1775537362\" width=698 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/938bd30441ae808b3cdfa1747bcebe3a.webm?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/938bd30441ae808b3cdfa1747bcebe3a.mp4?t=1775537362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Intense Bosses in Challenging Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Brimvahl Crown is easy to learn yet hard to master. as you guide Kazmiel to become the Pantocrator once again and save the world from the Deathless King, you'll need to explore the balance between attacking and avoiding damage, doing parries, and use a variety of skills, spells, and combos, and perfect your timing to take advantage of the opponent's weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579060/extras/5cefbee31b591e48bd2ddf3817546c3e.poster.avif?t=1775537362\" width=698 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_